    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just taking up space at this point. everything i do just ends up being more work for everyone else. i hate that they have to constantly check on me or help me with stuff i used to do myself. it feels like i'm just a heavy weight they're all forced to carry around.",
