    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "its not just a feeling though. it's how my life actually looks. i watch them struggle with me, getting tired, looking frustrated... and i know they love me but i also know they'd have so much more freedom if i wasn't constantly dragging them down. it feels like the only thing i can actually do for them now is just stop being a problem.",
