    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so heavy. like, if i could just make it stop, they could finally breathe again without having to worry about me constantly. it feels like the most selfless thing i could do is just step out of the way so they can actually live their lives. do you think people really do feel more relieved when a person like me is gone?",
